{
  "title": "Ukrainian Beef Borscht",
  "description": "A traditional Ukrainian dish featuring beef, vegetables, and a hint of resinous flavor, often served on sick days due to its comforting properties. This recipe uses bicarbonate of soda and infuse oil for added depth.",
  "cuisine": "Ukrainian",
